Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.82,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1226.666,746)}第1話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.82,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1510.666,823.999)}櫻花季的邂逅與暴風雪的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:18.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:18.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰涼的距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:24.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:24.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些許愁緒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:30.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:30.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}與一盞盞點亮的路燈遙相呼應
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.36,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.36,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}覺察到心中一點點積攢的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:44.01,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:44.01,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是裝酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.90,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.90,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像會被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.06,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.06,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,溫柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:52.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:52.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,凍結一分鐘 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.32,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.32,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:01:01.44,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:01:01.44,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想讓你說  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.60,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.60,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我愛你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.63,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.63,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,說不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:15.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:15.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能說出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  你要好好看家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:01:59.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我會給你帶手信的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:10.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天是就職儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:13.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也終於步入社會了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:18.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雖說如此  感覺與以往也沒什麼不同
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從學生時代開始…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月同學好酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  好沉著冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:29.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就總被這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可能比別人更缺乏感性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:17.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  您的腿怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:20.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噢…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:25.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天是就職儀式  太緊張了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:31.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為腿凍成冰塊離不開這個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在試圖看櫻花讓自己冷靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:46.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也有試過幾次  緊張到走不動路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但我還是第一次見到物理性質上的凍住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:55.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我帶了熱茶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,倒點下去怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:02.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,完全沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他到底有多緊張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您要…喝茶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這可真是  給您添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:32.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:38.46,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,海帶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  裂開了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:55.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,春天挺不錯的對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其實是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:09.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪…女？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  雪女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:19.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一旦情緒有波動  就會結出冰來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:24.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妖怪…的後裔？  我還是第一次見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:30.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為是雪女的後裔  經常被人以為喜歡冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,花開爛漫  能有新邂逅的春天…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:42.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其實也喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:52.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝您的茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:53.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,託您的福  我沒那麼緊張了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:02.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,再會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從不會表現出驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也沒什麼喜歡的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:24.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,學生時代的我  的確是那樣子的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:28.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:33.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一上來遇到了過去沒遇過的類型
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還能再見到他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為太過緊張凍成冰塊的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我已經試過好幾次了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:48.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:52.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,遇到那樣的人還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,既親切又溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來我們  是同一家公司的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來真有這麼巧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:38.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  之後就是同事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:51.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能在這裡再見面真是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:57.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什麼  這是什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毛茸茸…的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:10.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  我其實是妖狐的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:11.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是雪女的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:16.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:20.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冴島
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:25.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:29.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫狐森
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.69,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,您也是什麼的後裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您也是什麼的後裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:37.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是人類的後裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從今往後  請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:42.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說回來  從剛才我就很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那位部長…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是大佛的後裔嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:58.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不不  大佛只是一尊佛像罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來只是長得像嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:05.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是加了扇貝和鯛魚的鰹魚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:22.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  我今天認識了好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:27.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有預感  會發生未曾體驗過的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:28.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:31.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是給你看家的獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:36.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜歡就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小貓咪行為
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真期待明天的到來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  冰室先生  有點冷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:25.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  一不小心就入神了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜歡花嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:37.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…我碰到的東西都會凍住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是會下霜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:47.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:50.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可以說是喜愛花
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,卻不被花所愛的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:02.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,肯定有什麼其他方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:04.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對吧  喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:10.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不介意的話  請試試這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.11,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,園藝用純國產
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.11,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,鋪地稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:20.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,稻草？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:24.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,鋪地的稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:30.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能避免植物因下霜而枯萎的優良產品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:35.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,花和冰室先生都無精打采的就太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以我就查了查有沒有辦法解決
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:40.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等等…冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是扛著這袋稻草來上班的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:48.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有考慮到給周圍人添麻煩的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以是搭始發電車來的  別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  你真是個好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他笑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:05.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能幫上你的忙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:06.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐好溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,老喜歡她了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:22.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被她這樣對待  我會融化掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你一臉認真地在看什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還有  我稍微有點冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:46.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不知不覺就看入迷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.20,Koori-picture1,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.368\pos(758,134)}熱門帖子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:48.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,貓？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我雖然喜歡貓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:56.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但心情一激動身邊就會結冰  沒法摸它們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:08.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以  只能看貓片來治癒身心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:12.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來  我家也養了隻貓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:24.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊  我也想摸摸真的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:42.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個  不介意的話請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:45.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是貓的鬍鬚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:46.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,鬍鬚？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我家貓的鬍鬚有時候會掉到地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把它們一根根收集起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是摸不了真正的貓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想  至少可以摸摸真的鬍鬚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:13.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且  貓的鬍鬚好像可以作護身符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:18.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望…冰室先生能好事常伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:26.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,總覺得  給男人送護身符  有點害羞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太可愛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  竟然為了我的幸福祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:46.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,鬍鬚護身符也太靈了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:49.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,貓  貓的鬍鬚最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他那麼迷戀貓的鬍鬚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是個嚇人的愛貓人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真是太溫柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:06.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也想為冬月小姐做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:14.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,請吃甜點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這不是那個  限時搶購很有人氣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:31.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是巧克力橙子開心果冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:35.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐你  之前說過想嚐嚐的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是到處都賣光了  買不到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊不是  我只是碰巧買到了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:54.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,到  到處找了一週的事絕對要向她保密
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:59.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他其實是四處尋找才買到給我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:03.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這也太可愛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:10.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想說謝謝的反倒是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:12.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小雪人  很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,完蛋  我太開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明只是一點小小的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:24.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她卻百萬倍地還給了我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:26.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等下  冰室先生  好冷啊好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天天氣很好  感覺很舒適呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說  冬月小姐你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:39.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對冰室先生很親切啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:41.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:43.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我對他很普通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真是個大好人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:53.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:58.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐確實是個好人…痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她真是個  超級大好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪洞？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:17.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他心情一消沉  好像就會躲進雪洞裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天好像是犯了什麼錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:26.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像是因為他花一天時間做的資料數據丟失了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,部長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我跟他說明天再弄也行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但他本人堅持
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  我今天能做完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就這樣  沒聽我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真像是冰室先生會做的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天要加班了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:54.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其實我犯了個大錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:57.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有什麼我能幫你的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是我自己的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:11.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那你辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:15.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你也辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:30.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要太勉強自己了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:33.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:42.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被冬月小姐關心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:47.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她不僅僅是可愛  還兼具帥氣感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴島先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你的臉怎麼這麼紅？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:03.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有點感冒  好像發燒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,別太勉強自己  今天早點回去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也想早點回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:15.21,Koori-picture2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1154,646)\frz10.25}公司內項目表
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可今天的工作毫無進展
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我給你做個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:23.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,手作退燒貼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不這個  絕對貼不上去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不需要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  你試試看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:31.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,穿著西裝？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:33.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把毛巾纏到腦袋上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,像喝多了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真是任性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:41.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是任性  不用你操心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:43.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那把這份文件給我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,健康管理也是很重要的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我會幫你做完的  你趕緊回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:00.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,基本都被他拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:05.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你人真溫柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:06.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒有的事  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這點文件算不了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:11.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且我們是同事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:12.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被她夸溫柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他製造出來的東西很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:32.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,卻是個熱心腸的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:33.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:35.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:38.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我回來了  喵梅洛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:43.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有乖乖看家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,終於睡在裡面了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但你還會回來的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:13.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,從那天起  到今天剛好一個月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:19.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,進入公司到今天已經一個月了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  真是個好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我真是進了個好公司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,當社會人最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:44.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,下週的新員工研修旅行的目的地已經定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:46.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,去沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:48.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:49.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:54.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,衝  沖繩？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:01.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  我要是去了沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:04.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,會發生不得了的事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:25.15,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.15,0:22:32.49,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:25.15,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,突然發覺之時  視線又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.15,0:22:32.49,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,突然發覺之時  視線又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:39.83,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.83,0:22:47.17,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:39.83,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,即使遇上壞事  心也如雨後初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.83,0:22:47.17,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,即使遇上壞事  心也如雨後初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:54.47,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:23:00.56,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:54.47,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,你的笑容為何  如此和煦溫暖春風拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:23:00.56,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,你的笑容為何  如此和煦溫暖春風拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:08.07,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:08.07,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  只要是關於你什麼都行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:15.16,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:15.16,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告訴我  你喜歡的事也好物也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:22.77,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:22.77,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  總會有一天我們的距離
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:33.48,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:33.48,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,我無比期待著  它能一點一點日漸縮短
